<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa shares last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa shares last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said non-residents were net buyers of 497.854 million rand worth of South African shares last week.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand) -</p>
<p>			   Week to Feb 7    Year to date   Year ago</p>
<p>Equities:</p>
<p>- purchases		   1,702.26    5,666.105	5,204.549</p>
<p>- sales			 1,204.41    5,176.740	4,200.033</p>
<p>- net purchases/(sales)    497.854	489.365	1,004.516</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures reflect only the portion of the market where non-resident transactions are executed through the JSE, and are therefore not comprehensive.</p>
<p>The JSE said it registered a record 42,467 deals on the exchange last week.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
